OL,3,AVenezuelan opposition leader Maria
OL,4,AMachado returns after months in exile
OL,5,
OL,6,FVenezuelan opposition leader Maria
OL,7,FCorina Machado has returned home to a
OL,8,Ffraught political landscape after more
OL,9,Fthan 10 months in exile.
OL,11,F"I am here. With you," Machado wrote on
OL,12,FX on Sunday. Her return comes after
OL,13,Frepeated prior efforts to re-enter the
OL,14,Fcountry came to no avail.
OL,16,FIn January, a month after Machado left
OL,17,FVenezuela on a speedboat under cover of
OL,18,Fdarkness to accept the Nobel Peace
OL,19,FPrize in Norway, the US seized her
OL,20,Fopponent, President Nicolas Maduro.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
